Package authors can define representations for both forms with
[`MakeBoxes`](./../Formatting/MakeBoxes). See
[Decorating symbols](./../Advanced/Decorating-symbols) for custom symbolic
formatting.

## Arrange expressions

Unlike a string formatter, layout functions keep their arguments as
expressions. A row can therefore contain text, formulas, graphics, colors, or
controls at the same time.

### Rows and columns

[`Row`](./../Formatting/Row) places the elements of a list horizontally.
Strings are displayed as normal text without quotation marks:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Package authors can define representations for both forms with
[`MakeBoxes`](./../Formatting/MakeBoxes). See
[Decorating symbols](./../Advanced/Decorating-symbols) for custom symbolic
formatting.

## Arrange expressions

Unlike a string formatter, layout functions keep their arguments as
expressions. A row can therefore contain text, formulas, graphics, colors, or
controls at the same time.

### Rows and columns

[`Row`](./../Formatting/Row) places the elements of a list horizontally.
Strings are displayed as normal text without quotation marks:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Row[{"1", Graphics[Arrow[{{0,0}, {1,0}}], ImageSize->{35,18}], "2"}]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*GB[*){{"1"(*|*),(*|*)(*VB[*)(Graphics[Arrow[{{0, 0}, {1, 0}}], ImageSize -> {35, 18}])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KWlMIB4HkHAvSizIyEwuhsizAgnHoqL8cogCkHKfzOISVF4mkGYAE2jijJjiQaU5qcWcQIZnbmJ6anBmVSqaHmWQHiEgAQDZch2x"*)(*]VB*)(*|*),(*|*)"2"}}(*||*)(*1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAo5gUSYZmp5S6pyflFiSX5RcEsQBH3oswUAJ89CUc=*)(*]GB*)

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Any expression is valid:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Any expression is valid:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
