Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Several small formatting functions cover common visual effects:

| Expression | Description |
| --- | --- |
| [`Framed`](./../Formatting/Framed) | Draw a frame around an expression |
| [`Highlighted`](./../Formatting/Highlighted) | Apply a basic highlight |
| [`Squiggled`](./../Formatting/Squiggled) | Add a colored squiggled underline |
| [`Magnify`](./../Formatting/Magnify) | Scale an expression visually |
| [`Rotate`](./../Formatting/Rotate) | Rotate an expression |
| [`Invisible`](./../Formatting/Invisible) | Hide an expression while preserving its layout space |
| [`Spacer`](./../Formatting/Spacer) | Insert explicit empty space |

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Several small formatting functions cover common visual effects:

| Expression | Description |
| --- | --- |
| [`Framed`](./../Formatting/Framed) | Draw a frame around an expression |
| [`Highlighted`](./../Formatting/Highlighted) | Apply a basic highlight |
| [`Squiggled`](./../Formatting/Squiggled) | Add a colored squiggled underline |
| [`Magnify`](./../Formatting/Magnify) | Scale an expression visually |
| [`Rotate`](./../Formatting/Rotate) | Rotate an expression |
| [`Invisible`](./../Formatting/Invisible) | Hide an expression while preserving its layout space |
| [`Spacer`](./../Formatting/Spacer) | Insert explicit empty space |

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Row[{
  Framed[x + y],
  Spacer[20],
  Squiggled["check this", Red]
}]

