### Visible labels

[`Labeled`](./../Formatting/Labeled) attaches a visible expression at `Top`,
`Bottom`, `Left`, or `Right`:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
### Visible labels

[`Labeled`](./../Formatting/Labeled) attaches a visible expression at `Top`,
`Bottom`, `Left`, or `Right`:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
