.md
`expr[[row, column]]` is Wolfram Language's one-based part syntax, roughly
corresponding to two-dimensional indexing in Python or Julia. The span `2 ;;`
means “from position 2 through the end.”

### `MatrixForm`, `Row`, and `Column`

The same copy-and-paste workflow works with [`MatrixForm`](./../Formatting/MatrixForm):

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
`expr[[row, column]]` is Wolfram Language's one-based part syntax, roughly
corresponding to two-dimensional indexing in Python or Julia. The span `2 ;;`
means “from position 2 through the end.”

