.md
`Deploy` traverses the complete displayed expression and makes the decorated
content non-selectable and non-editable. It is particularly useful for
dashboards, controls, and presentation output:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
`Deploy` traverses the complete displayed expression and makes the decorated
content non-selectable and non-editable. It is particularly useful for
dashboards, controls, and presentation output:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Deploy @ Panel[
  Grid[{
    {"Name", InputText[]},
    {"Value", InputRange[0, 1, 0.1]}
  }, Alignment -> {{Left, Right}, Center}, Spacings->{1,0}],
  "Controls"
]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
